le in.\n\nROLL WITH THE CHAOS\nDraft a dream team of champions from a shared multiplayer pool, where bold picks, last-second pivots, and sudden serendipity can reshape the battlefield. Clash round after round to be the last Tactician standing, using creativity and cunning to turn unpredictable drafts and game-changing events into winning tactics.\n\nBRING YOUR FRIENDS\nChallenge your friends and stir up rivalries across PC, Mac, and mobile. Queue up together and see whose brilliant schemes (or lucky breaks) take them to the top.\n\nRISE UP THE RANKS\nFull competitive support and PvP matchmaking mean there’s always a worthy opponent ready to put your comp to the test. Take those top-tier strategies all the way from Iron to Challenger, and claim exclusive Ranked rewards at the end of every set!\n\nSTYLE ON ‘EM\nFlaunt your favorite Little Legend on the battlefield, defeat foes with a flourish using booms and finishers, and fashionably traverse realms with portals. Play your way to fresh new looks from the Pass or Pass+, or by purchasing them in the TFT store.\n\nDownload and play Teamfight Tactics today!","SkuTitle":"Teamfight Tactics","SkuButtonTitle":"","DeliveryDateOverlay":null,"SkuDisplayRank":[],"TextResources":null,"Images":[],"LegalText":{"AdditionalLicenseTerms":"","Copyright":"© 2019-2026 Riot Games, Inc. TEAMFIGHT TACTICS and any associated logos are trademarks, service marks, and/or registered trademarks of Riot Games, Inc.  ","CopyrightUri":"","PrivacyPolicy":"","PrivacyPolicyUri":"https://www.riotgames.com/en/privacy-notice","Tou":"","TouUri":""},"Language":"en","Markets":["US","DZ","AR","AU","AT","BH","BD","BE","BR","BG","CA","CL","CN","CO","CR","HR","CY","CZ","DK","EG","EE","FI","FR","DE","GR","GT","HK","HU","IS","IN","ID","IQ","IE","IL","IT","JP","JO","KZ","KE","KW","LV","LB","LI","LT","LU","MY","MT","MR","MX","MA","NL","NZ","NG","NO","OM","PK","PE","PH","PL","PT","QA","RO","RU","SA","RS","SG","SK","SI","ZA","KR","ES","SE","CH","TW","TH","TT","TN","TR